            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks foe the suggestion!\r\n\r\n'mini.map' allows creating [custom integrations](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/7ebfab26d77a4b9b05aaae565907e7fa4b2ee154/doc/mini-map.txt#L285). I don't think integration for marks will be built-in.\r\n\r\nClosing as not planned.\r\n\r\n------\r\n\r\nI'd encourage you to try and create integration that suits you best here. If you don't have time/enthusiasm to do it yourself, I can help with at least some challenging aspects here if you describe what you want 'mini.map' to display and how.",
