            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Thanks much for the offer! I guess what I'm missing is some example code to show how custom integration looks / works. Some sample code to start with could be super helpful. Ultimately, I'd like to display the `mark` within the map at its approximate location. Below is a combination of `satellite` and `MiniMap`\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6172bd16-5aac-4795-8f30-3cd1806f3688)\r\n",
